{"id":"108030-22-42de","year":108,"exam":"108年第一次專門職業及技術人員高等考試醫師牙醫師藥師考試分階段考試、醫事檢驗師、醫事放射師、物理治療師、職能治療師、呼吸治療師、獸醫師考試","level":"專技高考","subject":"獸醫藥理學","code":"2314","type":"測驗題","fixed":false,"classes":["獸醫師"],"source":"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?t=Q&code=108030&c=314&s=22&q=1","essays":[],"mcq":[{"no":1,"q":"Phenoxybezamine與α 受體的結合可被視為：1","opts":["全致效劑（full agonist）","部分致效劑（partial agonist）","競爭性拮抗劑（competitive antagonist）","非競爭性拮抗劑（non-competitive antagonist）"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":2,"q":"有關藥品命名的敘述，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["局部⿇醉劑常以「caine」結尾","β-blocker常以「olol」結尾","⽣物鹼（alkaloids）常以「ine」結尾","由Streptomyces所產⽣的抗⽣素，常以「micin」結尾"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":3,"q":"有關藥品名稱的敘述，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["meperidine和pethidine為相同的藥品","sulfamethazine和sulfadimidine為相同的藥品","acetaminophen和paracetamol為相同的藥品","ergonovine和ergometrine為不同的藥品"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":4,"q":"有關劑型的敘述，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["栓劑的溶解常和溫度相關","⼝服磨粉後的腸衣錠不能增加⽣體可⽤率（bioavailability）","1號膠囊的容量為0.5mL","⽔溶性軟膏的基質常為petrolatum"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":5,"q":"有關經⽪吸收（transdermal absorption）藥品的敘述，下列何者正確？","opts":["增加藥品的脂溶性，必可平⾏增加藥品的吸收","經⽪膚吸收的過程中皆不會發⽣藥品的代謝","因吸收緩慢，同⼀劑量的⽪膚貼布常能以相同的⽅式⽤於不同種別的動物","Fentanyl⽌痛貼布現已被使⽤於⽝、貓與⾺"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":6,"q":"有關投藥的敘述，下列何者正確？","opts":["除了靜脈注射外，其他任何給藥⽅式皆需要經過吸收步驟才會產⽣藥效","若能增快胃的排空速率，必能增加吸收⼝服藥品的百分率","投予的劑量（dose）為預測藥效的最佳⽅式","緩釋劑型常可保持較為穩定的⾎中濃度"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":7,"q":"有關靜脈注射barbital和thiopental的敘述，下列何者正確？","opts":["注射1分鐘後，barbital在腦中濃度較⾎中濃度為⾼","注射1分鐘後，thiopental在腦中濃度較⾎中濃度為⾼","注射1分鐘後，在腦中thiopental的濃度較barbital的濃度為⾼","barbital的脂溶性較thiopental為⾼"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":8,"q":"有關⾎漿蛋⽩結合特性的敘述，下列何者正確？","opts":["半衰期⻑的藥品皆是因藥品與⽩蛋⽩以共價鍵結合","與⾎漿蛋⽩結合的藥品⼀定無法經由腎臟排泄","嚴重的低⽩蛋⽩⾎症不會改變藥品的⽩蛋⽩結合率","在嚴重的肝硬化時，主要是降低酸性藥品和⽩蛋⽩結合"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":9,"q":"若擬於60 L⽔量之⽔族箱中投予25 ppm之A藥，購得含A藥有效成分10%之藥劑，則應加入多少mL之該藥劑，始能達到預期之效果？","opts":["0.15","1.5","15","30"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":10,"q":"影響藥物能否穿過⾎腦障壁（blood-brain barrier）的主要因素為何？","opts":["藥物的分⼦量","藥物的脂溶性","藥物的⽣體可⽤率","藥物的排除速率"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":11,"q":"⽣體可⽤率（bioavailability）愈⾼，代表投藥後：","opts":["脂肪組織中累積愈多","藥物半衰期愈⻑","藥物分布愈廣","能被吸收之藥物愈多"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":12,"q":"⻑時間使⽤某⼀藥品，藥效漸減⽽需增加劑量才能達到原始效果的現象稱為：","opts":["成癮性（addiction）","感受性（sensitivity）","專⼀性（specificity）","耐受性（tolerance）"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":13,"q":"下列何者是藥物動⼒學C 之意義？max","opts":["藥物之最⼤代謝速率","藥物最⼤之分布容積","⾎漿中藥物之最⾼濃度","藥物所產⽣之最⼤效應"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":14,"q":"使⽤ketamine後的⿇醉恢復期，較易⾒的副作⽤為何？","opts":["呼吸抑制","低⾎壓","腎毒性","蹣跚興奮"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":15,"q":"下列何者不是α -受體的致效劑？2","opts":["xylazine","ranitidine","detomidine","medetomidine"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":16,"q":"下列何者對於增強肝臟P-450代謝酵素活性有最⼤效果？","opts":["amobarbital","secobarbital","pentobarbital","phenobarbital"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":17,"q":"吸入性⿇醉劑在肺泡中的氣體濃度下降速率愈快，則表⽰：","opts":["⽣物轉換速率愈快","⿇醉之恢復愈快","溶解度愈⼤","⿇醉劑之重分布"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":18,"q":"下列何者無法阻斷神經肌⾁接合處終板電位的產⽣？","opts":["succinylcholine","pancuronium","edrophonium","hemicholinium"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":19,"q":"有關scopolamine的使⽤，下列何者正確？","opts":["為⻑效型藥物","可治療因motion sickness引起的嘔吐","主要作⽤為拮抗α -受體2","最常⽤於貓"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":20,"q":"下列何者為β -腎上腺素性受體活化後之主要藥理作⽤？1","opts":["散瞳","抑制唾液分泌","增加⼼跳速率","抑制肝醣分解"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":21,"q":"下列何者為經⼝投予phenylephrine之主要臨床⽤途？","opts":["解除⿐黏膜充⾎","治療腦性⾼⾎壓","治療鬱⾎性⼼衰竭","收縮瞳孔治療青光眼"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":22,"q":"下列治療⾼⾎壓的藥物，何者之作⽤機制為刺激腦幹神經細胞α 接受器，因⽽降低交感神經活性？2","opts":["reserpine","prazosin","guanethidine","clonidine"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":23,"q":"下列何者會抑制鈣離⼦流入⼼臟傳導系統的細胞？","opts":["amiodarone","atenolol","verapamil","flecainide"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":24,"q":"下列何者為鈣離⼦阻斷劑，且能使⾎管平滑肌擴張？","opts":["amlodipine","minoxidil","atenolol","hydralazine"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":25,"q":"下列何者為使⽤enalapril後之主要藥理作⽤？","opts":["增加⼼肌收縮⼒","促進腎素（renin）分泌","擴張靜脈及⼩動脈","利尿⽽消除肺部積⽔"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":26,"q":"Chlorothiazide利尿劑主要作⽤於腎⼩管的那個部位？","opts":["近曲⼩管（proximal tubule）","收集管（collecting tubule）","亨利⽒環上昇端（ascending limb of the loop of Henle）","遠曲⼩管（distal tubule）"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":27,"q":"使⽤下列何種利尿劑可能引發⾼⾎鉀之副作⽤？","opts":["bumetanide","ethacrynic acid","hydrochlorothiazide","spironolactone"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":28,"q":"下列何者作⽤於亨利⽒環上昇端？","opts":["ethacrynic acid","amiloride","spironolactone","triamterene"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":29,"q":"下列何者之作⽤機制主要為抑制碳酸酐酶？","opts":["acetazolamide","aminophylline","furosemide","thiazides"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":30,"q":"下列何者是ranitidine促進胃腸蠕動的作⽤機轉？","opts":["刺激腸道神經","抑制⼄醯膽鹼酯酶（acetylcholinesterase）","阻斷組織胺（histamine）受體","阻斷多巴胺（dopamine）受體"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":31,"q":"下列影響腸胃功能的藥物中，何者最容易引起尿液滯留的副作⽤？","opts":["cimetidine","misoprostol","omeprazole","propantheline"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":32,"q":"下列何者經⼝投予⽝後，可能會導致糞便呈現⿊⾊？","opts":["bismuth subsalicylate","misoprostol","omeprazole","sucralfate"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":33,"q":"下列何者不具⽌吐作⽤？","opts":["dolasetron","droperidol","morphine","promethazine"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":34,"q":"下列⽀氣管擴張劑何者屬於非選擇性β-受體致效劑（nonselectiveβ-receptor agonists）？","opts":["ephedrine","isoetharine","albuterol","terbutaline"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":35,"q":"下列那⼀種鴉片類藥物之鎮咳作⽤遠⼤於鎮痛作⽤？","opts":["codeine","fentanyl","morphine","hydromorphone"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":36,"q":"下列何種藥物不具有鎮咳作⽤？","opts":["hydrocodone","butorphanol","bromhexine HCl","dextromethorphan"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":37,"q":"下列何者是β -selective氣管擴張劑？2","opts":["epinephrine","terbutaline","isoproterenol","ephedrine"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":38,"q":"貓因下列何種因素⽽需⼩⼼使⽤NSAIDs藥物？","opts":["無法排泄此類藥物","NSAIDs對⾎中蛋⽩具⾼度結合⼒，致使藥物半衰期很⻑，容易有藥物蓄積中毒情形","cytochrome p450及葡萄醛酸接合系統不⾜","P-醣蛋⽩質排除效率低"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":39,"q":"下列何者為貓acetaminophen中毒時的最佳解毒劑？","opts":["atropine","acetylcysteine","physostigmine","pralidoxime"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":40,"q":"下列何者主要作⽤於⾎清素的受體？","opts":["atropine","cloprostenol","captopril","ketanserin"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":41,"q":"下列何者具有⾎管擴張活性？","opts":["bradykinin","diphenhydramine","ouabain","digitoxin"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":42,"q":"下列何者可⽤於治療副甲狀腺功能低下症？","opts":["dihydrotachysterol","calcitonin","levothyroxine","liothyronine"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":43,"q":"下列何者因需在動物體內轉化後才具有活性，故應避免使⽤於貓？","opts":["prednisone","prednisolone","hydrocortisone","deoxycorticosterone"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":44,"q":"下列何者屬⻑效型glucocorticoids？","opts":["hydrocortisone","cortisone","triamcinolone","dexamethasone"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":45,"q":"⾁食獸因下列何種維⽣素被不飽和脂肪酸破壞⽽缺乏時，易發⽣脂肪組織炎？","opts":["A","B","D","E"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":46,"q":"下列何者與體內鈣、磷的代謝控制無關？","opts":["parathyroid hormone","calcitonin","vitamine D","phytonadione"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":47,"q":"下列何者含有動物體內⼤部分的鐵？","opts":["globulin","hemoglobin","thyroxine","ceruloplasmin"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":48,"q":"家禽缺乏下列何種礦物質，會引起脫腱症、脛骨踝畸形與腓腸肌異位？","opts":["fluorine","copper","chromium","manganese"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":49,"q":"下列何者之作⽤機制為抑制病毒的核糖核蛋⽩進入宿主細胞？","opts":["amantadine","zidovudine","oseltamivir","famciclovir"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":50,"q":"下列何者為idoxuridine的作⽤機制？","opts":["防⽌病毒轉錄後的轉譯作⽤","終⽌病毒的DNA的合成","抑制神經胺酸酶","抑制病毒脫殼"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":51,"q":"於產食性經濟動物屠宰前之停藥期間，主要由下列那⼀因素所決定？","opts":["給藥之間隔","給藥之途徑","藥物之吸收速率","組織之殘留期間"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":52,"q":"Fluoroquinolones對敏感性細菌於增殖時，主要造成下列何種變化？","opts":["細胞壁不完整","細胞膜破裂","DNA裂解","蛋⽩質胺基酸變異"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":53,"q":"下列那⼀藥物為耐酸⽽可以⼝服給予之廣效性青黴素？","opts":["methicillin","ticarcillin","amoxicillin","penicillin G"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":54,"q":"單環內醯胺類（monobactams）藥物，主要使⽤於治療下列何種微⽣物之嚴重感染？","opts":["⾰蘭⽒陰性菌","⾰蘭⽒陽性菌","黴漿菌","原蟲"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":55,"q":"下列何者的作⽤機制與細菌核糖體30S次單位體無關？","opts":["oxytetracycline","neomycin","chloramphenicol","kanamycin"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":56,"q":"Tetracyclines對下列何者較無治療效果？","opts":["Haemobartonella spp.","Ehrlichia spp.","Borelia spp.","Clostridium spp."],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":57,"q":"下列何種macrolides臨床上使⽤會造成⼼臟毒性？","opts":["tilmicosin","tylosin","clarithromycin","tildipirosin"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":58,"q":"Carbadox劑量過⾼易引起保育豬⽣⻑遲緩、便秘、脫⽔等不良反應，其原因與下列何者有關？","opts":["hypernatremia","hypercalcemia","hypoinsulinemia","hypoaldosteronism"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":59,"q":"下列何者屬於glycopeptide類抗菌劑？","opts":["ronidazole","pirlimycin","spectinomycin","vancomycin"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":60,"q":"下列何項組合可⽤於治療由Rhodococcus equi引起⾺的肺炎？","opts":["clarithromycin+rifampin","cefoxitin+clindamycin","flucytosine+amphotericin B","penicillin+streptomycin"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":61,"q":"某⽝服⽤某藥物後產⽣跛⾏、聽⼒受損、⽪膚發疹、蛋⽩尿及⾎液學檢查有BUN、creatinine增加情況，其最有可能為服⽤下列何種藥物中毒所致？","opts":["macrolides","lincosamides","aminoglycosides","tetracyclines"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":62,"q":"下列何者為vincristine毒殺腫瘤細胞的主要作⽤機制？","opts":["抑制胸腺嘧啶核苷酸合成酶（thymidylate synthase）","抑制細胞有絲分裂紡錘體微管的形成","抑制核糖核苷酸還原酶（ribonucleotide reductase）","抑制第⼆型拓樸異構酶（topoisomerase-II）"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":63,"q":"⽝隻使⽤cyclophosphamide，⽣物轉化產⽣acrolein最可能引起下列何種毒性？","opts":["⼼肌病變","肺纖維化","膀胱炎","神經病變"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":64,"q":"Rimantadine抗病毒作⽤機制是：","opts":["抑制病毒顆粒組裝","⼲擾病毒合成蛋⽩質","⼲擾病毒合成DNA","抑制reverse transcriptase"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":65,"q":"⼤多數抗腫瘤藥物會影響骨髓的造⾎機能，原因為何？","opts":["藥物促使腫瘤細胞轉移⾄骨髓","藥物抑制骨髓細胞的分裂","藥物殺死腫瘤細胞時釋放出毒性物質所致","藥物引起的過敏性反應"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":66,"q":"下列何者為抑菌性抗⽣素？","opts":["amoxicillin","oxytetracycline","bacitracin","streptomycin"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":67,"q":"下列何種抗菌劑為作⽤於30S核糖體次單位，且⼝服吸收差？","opts":["paromomycin","tylosin","clindamycin","rifampin"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":68,"q":"為降低難溶性磺胺劑在泌尿系統中產⽣結⽯，下列處置何者錯誤？","opts":["併⽤同類藥","供給充分⽔分","降低尿液的pH值","併⽤NaHCO3"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":69,"q":"下列何者為外寄⽣蟲殺滅劑？","opts":["naphazoline","lodoxamide","dinotefuran","hirudin"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":70,"q":"下列何者⽤於噴灑於家⽤物及動物⾝上，以預防跳蚤之蟲卵、蛹及幼蟲發育為成體？","opts":["methoprene","methoxychlor","methotrexate","methohexital"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":71,"q":"下列何者能有效及安全治療兔疥癬症？","opts":["dorzolamide","acetazolamide","doramectin","glycopyrrolate"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":72,"q":"臨床上，對於貓分離出Malassezia spp.的外⽿道炎，下列何者為最佳醫療⽅案？","opts":["⼝服tacrolimus","肌⾁注射amphotericin B","局部塗抹nystatin","局部塗抹imiquimod"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":73,"q":"下列何者為amphotericin B併⽤itraconazole的主要⽬的？","opts":["不會進入體循環","皆為⼝服投藥⽅便且有加乘作⽤","降低腎毒性","治療⽝和貓的腎上腺⽪質機能亢進症"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":74,"q":"下列何者結合⾄DNA並⼲擾寄⽣蟲複製，可⽤於治療⽝焦蟲症？","opts":["dichlorophene","clorsulon","imidocarb","fenthion"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":75,"q":"下列何種酵素受到ketoconazole的抑制？","opts":["cytochrome P-450","monoamine oxidase","cholinesterase","cyclooxygenase"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":76,"q":"Amphotericin B與黴菌細胞膜中何種固醇類的結合⼒特別強？","opts":["tetrahymanol","sitosterol","cholesterol","ergosterol"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":77,"q":"下列何者為治療⽝隻慢性銅中毒的⾸選解毒劑？","opts":["penicillamine","sodium thiosulfate","methylpyrazole","phytonadione"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":78,"q":"Desferrioxamine緩慢的靜脈點滴注射⽤以治療下列何種⾦屬中毒？","opts":["鐵","銅","汞","鎘"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":79,"q":"在治療氰化物（cyanide）中毒時，下列何者為佳？","opts":["ascorbic acid－oral","sodium nitrite－IV","methylene blue－SC","phytonadione－IM"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":80,"q":"有關有機氯殺蟲劑的敘述，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["易溶於⽔親脂性","環境中殘留時間⻑","易儲存於脂肪中","幼齡動物較老年動物感受性強"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]}],"answer":"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?t=S&code=108030&c=314&s=22&q=1"}